# Production environment for the frontend.
#
# Vite loads this file automatically for `vite build` (production mode), which
# is what both Netlify and Vercel run. That means the API URL is baked into
# the bundle without anyone having to remember to add a variable in a hosting
# dashboard.
#
# A VITE_API_BASE variable set in the host's dashboard still takes priority,
# so you can override this per deployment without changing code.
#
# Local development is unaffected: `npm run dev` runs in development mode,
# loads `.env.development`/`.env.local` instead, and falls back to the `/api`
# path handled by the Vite dev proxy in vite.config.js.
VITE_API_BASE=https://full-stack-captcha-earn-module-2.onrender.com/api
